# reports/tables/ — generated CSV and parquet tables
# All files here are gitignored (generated output, never committed).
# Tables produced by the pipeline:
#   cv_scores_stratified.parquet — fold scores from RepeatedStratifiedKFold
#   cv_scores_grouped.parquet    — fold scores from StratifiedGroupKFold
#   cv_scores_long.parquet       — merged long format (input to stats_tests.py)
#   friedman.csv                 — Friedman test result
#   wilcoxon_holm.csv            — Pairwise Wilcoxon + Holm correction
#   test_metrics.csv             — Per-model final test metrics
#   review_budget.csv            — Review-budget curve data
